---
layout: base.njk
title: Podcasts — CHIRP Radio
description: CHIRP Radio podcasts and on-demand episodes.
permalink: /podcasts/
---

<h1>Podcasts</h1>
<p>On-demand audio from CHIRP.</p>

<ul class="articles-list">
{% for podcast in cms.podcasts %}
  <li>
    <h3><a href="/podcasts/{{ podcast.slug }}/">{{ podcast.title }}</a></h3>
    <div class="meta">
      {{ podcast.publishedDate | chicagoDate }}
      {% if podcast.host and podcast.host.name %} · {{ podcast.host.name }}{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if podcast.excerpt %}<div class="excerpt">{{ podcast.excerpt }}</div>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
